  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greenworks:  Student Environmental Projects Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project funds student environmental stewardship projects around the world as part of our Greenworks Global Classroom.  Students and classrooms who participate in the Greenworks program complete a curriculum on Project Design (based on NASA mission designs), which helps shape their ideas on environmental stewardship into well-designed projects.  Currently, we partner with teachers, classrooms, and clubs in Indonesia (where the program was piloted), Brazil, Ukraine, South Korea, and the US.</narrative>
  </description>
